  "licenseInfo": "<p>These data are unvalidated planning estimates produced by City of Millcreek GIS from 2023 lidar. They are not surveyed, engineered or field-verified, and must not be used to determine property boundaries or ownership, building or site design, engineering, flood or drainage design, code compliance (including building height), or any legal or regulatory determination. They are provided as is, without warranty of accuracy, completeness or fitness for any purpose; check conditions on the ground before relying on them. Credit \"City of Millcreek GIS; 2023 Salt Lake Valley QL1 lidar (USGS 3DEP)\" when you use or show them.</p>",
